  const allEntraNavItems=[...entraNavItems,...entraMonitoringItems,...verifiedNavItems,['Tableau de bord','entra/global-secure','shield'],...globalGroups.flatMap(([, ,items])=>items.map(([label,route])=>[label,route,'document']))];
  function entraFavorites(){return Array.isArray(db.entraFavorites)?db.entraFavorites.filter(route=>allEntraNavItems.some(([,key])=>key===route)):[];}
  function entraNavEntry([label,route,ico],monitoring=false){const favorite=entraFavorites().includes(route);return `<div class="entra-nav-entry ${monitoring?'entra-monitoring-entry':''}">${sideItem(label,route,ico,true)}<button type="button" class="entra-nav-favorite ${favorite?'is-favorite':''}" role="switch" aria-checked="${favorite}" aria-label="${favorite?'Retirer des favoris':'Ajouter aux favoris'} : ${attr(label)}" title="${favorite?'Retirer des favoris':'Ajouter aux favoris'}" data-action="entra-favorite" data-arg="${attr(route)}">${favorite?'★':'☆'}</button></div>`;}
  function m365Pinned(){return Array.isArray(db.m365NavPinned)?db.m365NavPinned.filter(key=>m365NavItems.some(([id])=>id===key)):defaultM365Nav;}
  function syncM365NavSelectAll(form){const all=form?.querySelector?.('[data-m365-nav-select-all]');if(!all)return;const items=[...form.querySelectorAll('[name="items"]')],count=items.filter(item=>item.checked).length;all.checked=items.length>0&&count===items.length;all.indeterminate=count>0&&count<items.length;}
  function m365NavEntry(content,key,label){const pinned=m365Pinned().includes(key),verb=pinned?'Détacher':'Épingler';return `<div class="m365-nav-entry">${content}<button type="button" class="m365-nav-pin ${pinned?'is-pinned':''}" data-action="m365-nav-pin" data-arg="${attr(key)}" aria-label="${verb} ${attr(label)}" title="${verb} ${attr(label)}">${icon('pin')}</button></div>`;}
